WEBVTT

00:00:52.119 --> 00:00:54.679
In order to save the captured fairies...

00:00:54.789 --> 00:00:57.520
...Arusu decided to go after
the warlock cavalrymen.

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:01.186
With Sigma as their guide,
they went across a desert...

00:01:01.262 --> 00:01:04.630
...with no sign of life and
headed for the Warlock Realm.

00:01:04.899 --> 00:01:08.529
Along the way, they stopped by
Dark Mountain and found out that...

00:01:08.636 --> 00:01:12.004
...Sigma wanted to get his hands
on the True Book of Spells.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.772
In order to find out
why he wants the book...

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:18.869
...the three of them decided
to head into the Warlock Realm.

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:50.802
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.342 --> 00:02:59.802
Invade the Warlock Realm!

00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:03.748
Do you believe in magic?

00:03:03.884 --> 00:03:06.615
Yes! I'm gonna get on a broom
and fly in the sky.

00:03:06.787 --> 00:03:07.998
Where do you want to go?

00:03:08.022 --> 00:03:09.490
Where do you want to go?
Let's see...

00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:11.655
Beyond the sky!

00:03:11.759 --> 00:03:14.694
Well then, you'd better keep
that belief in a safe place.

00:03:14.828 --> 00:03:15.795
Belief?

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:18.556
That's right. A heart that believes.

00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:23.602
As long as you believe with all
your heart, anyone can use magic.

00:03:33.447 --> 00:03:35.347
My dad is coming home...

00:03:35.983 --> 00:03:38.748
My my papapapa payarinko!

00:03:49.697 --> 00:03:52.325
What's so special about that book?

00:03:57.037 --> 00:04:00.837
How come the warlocks want
to get a hold of that book?

00:04:02.543 --> 00:04:05.672
Why do they want to capture fairies?

00:04:07.114 --> 00:04:10.345
How come my dad had
the True Book of Spells?

00:04:12.186 --> 00:04:15.121
Where did my dad go?

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:19.919
You'll understand everything
when you come to...

00:04:20.027 --> 00:04:23.258
...Wizard Kingdom, also
known as the Warlock Realm.

00:04:24.531 --> 00:04:25.726
We're here.

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.430
This is it?

00:04:30.537 --> 00:04:32.403
Something kingdom?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.904
It's pretty deserted.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.638
Wizard Kingdom is just up ahead.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.377
Wizard Kingdom has a new government.

00:04:42.483 --> 00:04:46.716
They kicked out all the old wizards
and established a whole new world.

00:04:51.525 --> 00:04:54.551
Hey, can you give me something?
Come on!

00:04:55.896 --> 00:04:58.228
Don't do it. You shouldn't
get involved with them.

00:04:58.332 --> 00:05:00.630
But this kid seems hungry, so...

00:05:01.268 --> 00:05:03.669
Why are we stopping by
this place anyway?

00:05:03.771 --> 00:05:04.814
To disguise ourselves.

00:05:04.838 --> 00:05:05.737
To disguise ourselves.
A disguise?

00:05:05.839 --> 00:05:10.174
Only adult witches who will be married
soon can enter Wizard Kingdom.

00:05:10.244 --> 00:05:11.421
You should know that.

00:05:11.445 --> 00:05:12.276
You should know that.
Yeah.

00:05:12.713 --> 00:05:16.547
So we have to disguise
ourselves as adult witches?

00:05:16.884 --> 00:05:20.650
No matter how you disguise yourself,
you will never look like an adult.

00:05:20.821 --> 00:05:22.084
Warlock kid.

00:05:22.189 --> 00:05:24.385
You're going to dress up like a boy.

00:05:24.491 --> 00:05:26.084
Like a boy?

00:05:27.294 --> 00:05:27.886
Here.

00:05:27.995 --> 00:05:29.156
Are you sure?

00:05:29.263 --> 00:05:31.664
It's really good. Make sure to chew!

00:05:34.568 --> 00:05:37.333
These clothes are kind of big on me.

00:05:38.138 --> 00:05:41.802
Sheila looks like one of
those live-action heroes!

00:05:42.109 --> 00:05:43.804
What the heck is that?

00:05:44.144 --> 00:05:46.704
| guess they look okay.
I'll tell you one more thing.

00:05:46.814 --> 00:05:48.543
Don't use any magic from here on.

00:05:48.615 --> 00:05:49.582
I know.

00:05:54.588 --> 00:05:56.522
We can't use any magic?

00:05:56.657 --> 00:05:57.590
We can't.

00:05:57.725 --> 00:06:01.320
If we use any magic,
then our cover will be blown.

00:06:01.495 --> 00:06:02.121
Yeah.

00:06:02.262 --> 00:06:05.163
Wait a minute.
But they have adult witches, right?

00:06:05.365 --> 00:06:08.892
When a witch marries a warlock,
she can no longer use any magic.

00:06:09.002 --> 00:06:10.094
| see...

00:06:10.637 --> 00:06:12.196
That's strange.

00:06:30.257 --> 00:06:33.625
This is the Warlock Realm?

00:06:34.027 --> 00:06:36.121
Wizard Kingdom.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.098
What is this?

00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:43.127
Let's go. We need to eat something.

00:06:43.303 --> 00:06:44.236
Right?

00:06:44.338 --> 00:06:46.363
We're all hungry, right?

00:06:46.473 --> 00:06:47.702
Yeah.

00:06:48.509 --> 00:06:51.274
So what's the local specialty?
Pancakes?

00:06:51.378 --> 00:06:53.403
Or maybe it's chestnuts?

00:06:53.514 --> 00:06:56.882
We have everything here.
There's nothing we can't get.

00:06:56.984 --> 00:06:57.951
Everything?

00:06:58.085 --> 00:07:01.544
No way! Even chestnuts?
You even have chestnuts?

00:07:02.623 --> 00:07:03.749
Sheila?

00:07:03.924 --> 00:07:05.483
What is this?

00:07:05.893 --> 00:07:09.261
Wow! This is amazing!

00:07:19.807 --> 00:07:21.798
You made such a mess!

00:07:21.909 --> 00:07:24.344
Don't stare at them too much.
They might suspect us.

00:07:24.411 --> 00:07:25.674
Okay.

00:07:26.346 --> 00:07:30.681
Hey, I thought the Warlock Realm
is supposed to be really hot.

00:07:30.884 --> 00:07:35.082
The Alpha Element maintains a constant
temperature throughout the realm.

00:07:35.189 --> 00:07:38.352
That's awesome!
So it's like an air conditioner!

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:39.721
What's that?

00:07:41.495 --> 00:07:43.827
Wow! This is amazing!

00:07:43.931 --> 00:07:47.561
Meat, meat, veggies, meat, veggies!
They even have a cake!

00:07:47.634 --> 00:07:49.728
Brother! They even have chestnuts!

00:07:49.803 --> 00:07:51.080
It's so wonderful!

00:07:51.104 --> 00:07:51.866
It's so wonderful!
Hey!

00:07:52.539 --> 00:07:54.064
What's the matter?

00:07:54.174 --> 00:07:56.472
I mean, what the heck is going on?

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:57.202
Nothing.

00:07:57.377 --> 00:08:01.314
Brother! Are you sure?
I'm really gonna eat it all, you know!

00:08:01.415 --> 00:08:02.075
Sure.

00:08:02.249 --> 00:08:04.308
Thanks for the meal!

00:08:07.654 --> 00:08:09.418
I'm overwhelmed.

00:08:15.229 --> 00:08:17.994
This is amazing! How does this work?

00:08:18.332 --> 00:08:19.231
Well?

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:21.892
This place is amazing.

00:08:22.736 --> 00:08:23.225
What?

00:08:24.004 --> 00:08:25.733
This place has everything.

00:08:26.473 --> 00:08:29.738
There are men and women.
There's freedom.

00:08:30.577 --> 00:08:33.410
They're having fun, and they seem happy.

00:08:33.847 --> 00:08:37.750
Well, kids are supposed
to have fun for a living.

00:08:38.051 --> 00:08:39.985
| never even thought about it.

00:08:40.153 --> 00:08:43.248
Well, maybe you shouldn't
think too hard.

00:08:45.559 --> 00:08:50.121
Following traditions and rules.
Even though we're just a bunch of kids.

00:08:52.432 --> 00:08:55.663
Maybe we're the ones who were wrong.

00:08:55.736 --> 00:08:56.897
Sheila?

00:08:57.638 --> 00:09:00.938
| didn't realize our opponents
were extraordinary.

00:09:09.416 --> 00:09:10.884
You think so?

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:14.021
We can't beat them
with their technologies.

00:09:15.255 --> 00:09:16.984
I think we can.

00:09:20.327 --> 00:09:23.319
You said this place has everything.

00:09:23.497 --> 00:09:25.124
You got your chestnuts.

00:09:25.232 --> 00:09:29.328
But you see, this is not a chestnut.
It has numbers written on it!

00:09:30.337 --> 00:09:34.103
You can get whatever you want
whenever you want.

00:09:34.374 --> 00:09:35.705
It's wonderful, isn't it?

00:09:35.776 --> 00:09:36.743
Not at all.

00:09:37.144 --> 00:09:38.373
Don't raise your voice.

00:09:38.445 --> 00:09:41.039
This place has everything,
but they're actually nothing.

00:09:41.148 --> 00:09:42.912
They're all fake.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.817
Plus there's no magic.

00:09:46.253 --> 00:09:46.811
Huh?

00:09:47.154 --> 00:09:47.780
Hey!

00:09:48.989 --> 00:09:51.253
Where are the fairies?

00:09:51.358 --> 00:09:52.018
Stop this!

00:09:52.092 --> 00:09:54.618
Tell me the secret of
the True Book of Spells!

00:09:54.728 --> 00:09:56.423
Why are you guys capturing fairies?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.020
I told you to keep your voice down!

00:09:58.098 --> 00:09:59.896
You said we'd understand everything!

00:09:59.967 --> 00:10:04.495
You try to make everything work by
providing them with material objects!

00:10:04.604 --> 00:10:06.504
Is something wrong?

00:10:10.444 --> 00:10:12.037
It's the police.

00:10:12.446 --> 00:10:14.380
What was all the fuss about?

00:10:14.681 --> 00:10:17.981
| heard something about
magic and fairies.

00:10:18.051 --> 00:10:20.713
It's nothing. Really.

00:10:21.288 --> 00:10:23.313
Hey, she's an apprentice witch!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.984
You're right.
She's an apprentice witch!

00:10:28.228 --> 00:10:30.006
Don't tell me you're all witches too!

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:30.826
Don't tell me you're all witches too!
Let's go!

00:10:30.931 --> 00:10:31.489
Eva!

00:10:31.798 --> 00:10:33.163
Huh? What the...

00:10:34.334 --> 00:10:35.824
Hey, you right there!

00:10:37.571 --> 00:10:41.337
We found the three apprentice witches.
We need backup immediately!

00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:42.618
After them!

00:10:42.642 --> 00:10:43.507
After them!
After them!

00:10:58.658 --> 00:11:00.854
Hey, stop! I said stop!

00:11:03.697 --> 00:11:07.531
I'm telling you
we're not apprentice witches!

00:11:09.403 --> 00:11:11.030
Didn't you hear me?

00:11:11.271 --> 00:11:12.363
Be quiet!

00:11:12.472 --> 00:11:13.116
Capture her!

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:13.902
Capture her!
Yes, sir!

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:17.033
No way!

00:11:33.326 --> 00:11:36.318
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.867 --> 00:11:45.327
The True Wizard

00:12:04.791 --> 00:12:07.385
Well? What do you think
of my recovery spell?

00:12:07.461 --> 00:12:09.156
Recovery spell?

00:12:10.397 --> 00:12:11.023
Ouch!

00:12:11.164 --> 00:12:13.098
Oh, does it hurt? That's strange.

00:12:13.166 --> 00:12:16.261
You're supposed to be fully healed
from the recovery spell.

00:12:16.369 --> 00:12:19.270
Well, you're squeezing
my arm real tight...

00:12:19.372 --> 00:12:20.999
You're right.

00:12:22.843 --> 00:12:24.140
He's a natural?

00:12:24.244 --> 00:12:26.474
Sorry about that. My name is Wil.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:30.346
They kicked me out of Wizard Kingdom.
| used to be one of the wizards.

00:12:30.417 --> 00:12:33.318
| see, so you're the one
who saved me, old man?

00:12:33.453 --> 00:12:35.231
Stop calling me an old man.

00:12:35.255 --> 00:12:37.417
Stop calling me an old man.
Yeah, thanks, Wil.

00:12:37.557 --> 00:12:38.820
My name is Arusu.

00:12:38.925 --> 00:12:39.721
Arusu?

00:12:39.826 --> 00:12:40.315
Yeah.

00:12:40.427 --> 00:12:44.261
Now that's a terrible name.
Who gave you that name?

00:12:44.364 --> 00:12:45.559
My dad.

00:12:45.799 --> 00:12:49.133
What? Is there something terrible
associated with my name?

00:12:49.236 --> 00:12:51.227
Well, we'll talk about it later.

00:12:51.671 --> 00:12:53.833
Here. You must be very hungry.

00:12:54.908 --> 00:12:58.538
Huh? But I ate a lot just before...

00:12:58.645 --> 00:12:59.612
Just before?

00:12:59.679 --> 00:13:00.323
Just before.

00:13:00.347 --> 00:13:01.678
Just before.
That's odd.

00:13:01.882 --> 00:13:04.977
You've been sleeping for
three straight days now.

00:13:05.285 --> 00:13:06.844
Three straight days?

00:13:08.188 --> 00:13:09.849
Are you worried?

00:13:10.257 --> 00:13:11.725
Of course I am!

00:13:13.527 --> 00:13:14.237
Let's just go back.

00:13:14.261 --> 00:13:16.320
Let's just go back.
Do you want to get captured?

00:13:16.429 --> 00:13:16.952
But...

00:13:17.063 --> 00:13:20.124
We spent three days to come all
the way out here. Come with me.

00:13:20.433 --> 00:13:22.078
But we have to save Eva and Arusu!

00:13:22.102 --> 00:13:24.400
But we have to save Eva and Arusu!
Didn't you want to know the secret?

00:13:25.472 --> 00:13:29.739
We're almost at the Magical Realm's
source of life... the Sanctuary.

00:13:30.977 --> 00:13:33.469
There lies the truth to everything.

00:13:34.681 --> 00:13:38.208
So in order to find out about that secret,
you came all the way out...

00:13:38.318 --> 00:13:41.754
...to Wizard Kingdom despite all
the danger you might be facing?

00:13:42.756 --> 00:13:45.418
Plus if I find out the secret
to the book of spells...

00:13:45.525 --> 00:13:48.927
.| thought I could find out
what happened to my dad.

00:13:49.062 --> 00:13:51.394
| hope you can find the truth.

00:13:51.698 --> 00:13:52.529
Yeah.

00:13:52.699 --> 00:13:55.327
But they're pretty tough.

00:13:57.204 --> 00:14:01.766
One day, they just started saying
that science is going to be...

00:14:02.175 --> 00:14:06.442
...a reliable power instead of
an unreliable power like magic.

00:14:07.681 --> 00:14:11.640
The town changed.
We didn't have a place to stay anymore.

00:14:12.485 --> 00:14:15.477
| led my fellow wizards
and fought against...

00:14:15.589 --> 00:14:19.719
...the society that was filled with
mass production and mass consumption.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:24.121
But we were no match for science.

00:14:25.198 --> 00:14:29.101
You saw it, didn't you?
The huge civilization that they created.

00:14:30.337 --> 00:14:34.570
I hate to say this, but our
wizard traditions are about to...

00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:37.707
...come to an end from their attacks.

00:14:37.844 --> 00:14:39.073
Hey!

00:14:44.751 --> 00:14:46.128
That's my grandchild Nito.

00:14:46.152 --> 00:14:47.085
That's my grandchild Nito.
Really?

00:14:47.187 --> 00:14:50.782
He told me to help you.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.654
| see. That's why...

00:14:52.759 --> 00:14:54.955
Then you really have to do it.

00:14:55.128 --> 00:14:56.061
What do you mean?

00:14:56.129 --> 00:14:58.461
You have to protect your tradition.

00:14:58.565 --> 00:15:00.863
Plus you have such a cute grandchild.

00:15:00.967 --> 00:15:03.629
They're trying to wipe us out.

00:15:04.104 --> 00:15:07.734
We can't beat them and
their science that easily.

00:15:08.341 --> 00:15:11.538
You should know that since
you're fighting them too.

00:15:11.678 --> 00:15:16.206
I don't plan on fighting the
warlocks nor defeating them.

00:15:16.583 --> 00:15:18.813
Don't you want to save the fairies?

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:20.613
You're right, but...

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:24.748
| just like magic.
So I want to save them.

00:15:25.025 --> 00:15:28.859
But I don't want to hurt others by
using the magic that I really love.

00:15:28.995 --> 00:15:29.791
That's all.

00:15:29.896 --> 00:15:33.025
You say such interesting things
for a witch.

00:15:33.133 --> 00:15:34.999
I'm a human.

00:15:35.502 --> 00:15:36.333
Human?

00:15:37.604 --> 00:15:38.696
Ah, yeah.

00:15:38.805 --> 00:15:43.140
You've got to be kidding me.
Humans can't come to a place like this.

00:15:43.209 --> 00:15:44.608
But it's true!

00:15:44.711 --> 00:15:48.648
| thought using magic might be kind
of fun, and I was able to come here!

00:15:48.815 --> 00:15:52.615
Actually, if you believe with all
your heart, anyone can use magic.

00:15:52.719 --> 00:15:54.497
You're a wizard. You should know...

00:15:54.521 --> 00:15:55.750
You're a wizard. You should know...
What did you just say?

00:15:55.855 --> 00:15:59.758
| said if you believe with all
your heart, anyone can use magic...

00:15:59.893 --> 00:16:03.090
I guess I'm related to humans after all.

00:16:03.196 --> 00:16:03.719
What?

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:06.558
You're the second person...

00:16:07.801 --> 00:16:11.999
It was more than 10 years ago on the
night of a snowstorm. I'll never forget it.

00:16:12.238 --> 00:16:14.866
A strange man came by this place.

00:16:15.041 --> 00:16:17.601
He said he needed a place
to stay for the night.

00:16:17.711 --> 00:16:20.078
He also said the same thing.

00:16:20.513 --> 00:16:23.949
If you believe with all your heart,
anyone can use magic.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.849
He said to try your best
to protect this magic.

00:16:26.953 --> 00:16:30.082
He also said that he must go
to the Human Realm...

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:32.852
...in order to protect
that magic as well.

00:16:34.394 --> 00:16:37.261
Did that person have a book of spells?

00:16:37.664 --> 00:16:43.125
A book of spells?
I'm not sure if he had one with him.

00:16:43.737 --> 00:16:44.313
It's just...

00:16:44.337 --> 00:16:45.270
It's just...
It's just?

00:16:45.405 --> 00:16:48.966
He was with a little boy who was
probably not old enough to talk.

00:16:49.075 --> 00:16:52.443
More than 10 years ago...
That's before I was born!

00:16:52.579 --> 00:16:55.480
| let the man and
his boy get on a ship...

00:16:55.582 --> 00:16:58.142
...and sent him off to the Human Realm.

00:16:58.284 --> 00:17:00.514
He went to the Human Realm?

00:17:02.055 --> 00:17:03.352
What's going on?

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:07.518
I thought it was a graveyard. I thought
you couldn't get to the Human Realm.

00:17:07.627 --> 00:17:11.825
That's the kind of story that the
successive grand master made up.

00:17:12.165 --> 00:17:16.295
It's like telling the kids to go to
sleep early so the ghosts can't get you.

00:17:16.403 --> 00:17:17.336
What?

00:17:17.971 --> 00:17:20.372
Then Arusu can go home...

00:17:21.941 --> 00:17:23.773
I'm going to ask you once more.

00:17:23.877 --> 00:17:26.847
Why did you come to Wizard Kingdom?

00:17:27.313 --> 00:17:29.645
Apprentice witches
are not supposed to...

00:17:29.749 --> 00:17:31.979
...come to the Warlock Realm, right?

00:17:32.552 --> 00:17:34.919
You're pretty stubborn.

00:17:35.088 --> 00:17:37.614
You can't even use magic that well.

00:17:38.091 --> 00:17:41.152
Grande will decide what to do with you.

00:17:41.294 --> 00:17:43.786
| have a feeling
you won't go home alive.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.838
I'm no good...

00:17:51.971 --> 00:17:55.737
| came here to save the fairies,
but I can't do anything.

00:17:58.011 --> 00:18:00.173
| just received some news.

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:04.183
An apprentice witch is being
interrogated by the warlock police.

00:18:04.284 --> 00:18:06.013
| have to save her!

00:18:06.119 --> 00:18:08.554
You can't do anything now!
We should plan it...

00:18:08.655 --> 00:18:09.965
We don't have that kind of time!

00:18:09.989 --> 00:18:10.547
We don't have that kind of time!
Hey!

00:18:10.657 --> 00:18:12.751
It's like going in to get slaughtered!

00:18:13.293 --> 00:18:14.556
I'll be fine!

00:18:15.328 --> 00:18:19.526
But using magic is
like creating a miracle.

00:18:25.705 --> 00:18:27.901
Grande is waiting for you inside.

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.674
Hurry up and go in there!

00:18:34.781 --> 00:18:37.079
No! Help me!

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.344
I don't want to die!

00:18:48.127 --> 00:18:49.060
No...

00:18:52.265 --> 00:18:55.064
No!

00:18:57.637 --> 00:18:59.537
The Sanctuary is just up ahead.

00:18:59.606 --> 00:19:01.631
The truth is there, right?

00:19:02.842 --> 00:19:06.039
Even if you find out the truth,
you won't regret it, right?

00:19:08.281 --> 00:19:12.309
Looks like there's an intruder in
valve 3 of the D pressure control room.

00:19:12.719 --> 00:19:14.881
Are you serious? Is that me?

00:19:15.154 --> 00:19:17.521
All units. Proceed to
the area immediately.

00:19:17.624 --> 00:19:19.558
Oh no!

00:19:24.797 --> 00:19:26.788
Magic is so many times...

00:19:28.301 --> 00:19:31.532
...greater than those machines!

00:19:31.671 --> 00:19:32.934
Take this!

00:19:35.308 --> 00:19:36.901
Damn!

00:19:42.549 --> 00:19:43.710
We're here.

00:19:43.983 --> 00:19:46.247
The Magical Realm's source of life...

00:19:46.719 --> 00:19:47.845
The Sanctuary.

00:19:53.092 --> 00:19:54.560
No way...

00:19:55.495 --> 00:19:56.621
This is...

00:19:57.363 --> 00:20:00.526
...the truth that
you were telling me about?

00:20:17.717 --> 00:20:25.681
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.925 --> 00:20:33.925
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:35.101 --> 00:20:43.101
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.344 --> 00:20:49.908
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:50.016 --> 00:20:54.249
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:55.021 --> 00:20:59.254
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.359 --> 00:21:03.921
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:09.296
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.402 --> 00:21:12.463
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:18.571
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.678 --> 00:21:21.170
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:29.280
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.456 --> 00:21:36.190
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.295 --> 00:21:40.459
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
